    "findings": [
      "The six loaded Fungi assets are non-authorizing sandboxes; the five constant twins retain historical packages-galerina oracle paths that need provenance reconciliation.",
      "Null and undefined governance values default to full; invalid values also default to full, but String(requested) can invoke user coercion or throw.",
      "Explicit posture off remains off in production. CONTROLS_ON and CONTROLS_OFF are shared unfrozen objects, so returned controls alias mutable module state.",
      "deriveImportProfile requires signatures only for exact effective on; malformed runtime values can otherwise permit file paths.",
      "Egress relaxation recognizes exact true/1; production blocks loopback but does not block explicit plaintext relaxation, and allowed-host parsing lacks hostname validation.",
      "Handoffs use host time when generatedAt is absent, accept supplied timestamps without validation, carry override expiry without evaluating it, and retain configuration references.",
      "Secret presence rejects undefined and empty strings but accepts whitespace; defaults are not applied. Vault diagnostics interpolate key/type names, DEFAULT_SECRET_REDACTION_POLICY is inert, and getVaultEntry is an unchecked lookup/type assertion.",
      "isEnvironmentMode uses a private Set snapshot while isSecretConfigSourceKind reads a mutable exported array; preserve that distinction or obtain a separately authorized correction."
    ]
  },
